From 2a096b889e55b61410803d0ca961795862046884 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:21:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(input): stop copy mode's ^ and $ on the line's text

In copy mode $ and the copy_mode_line_end action went to the pane's last
column, past the blank padding, and ^ went to column zero like 0. ^ now
moves to the first nonblank character and $ to the last one, on the first
cell of a wide character, in normal mode and in a selection. A blank line
gives column zero. 0 and copy_mode_line_start still reach column zero.

A new copy_mode_first_nonblank action does what ^ does, so it can be
bound in [keybindings.copy_mode] like the line start and end actions.

Closes #980
